d or unfilled live entries never take window slots, and partial fills are not modelled. Indicators: Wilder RSI, EMA span 9 (adjust=False), MACD 14/22/9, Wilder ATR 14; trend from the live analyze_rsi_trend_confirmation on 499 closed 1m candles and 5m/15m derived from 1274.",
